{"version":1,"content":"<p>據Digitimes報道，<strong>威騰電子CEO在近期財報電話會上直言，AI本質上是數據系統，任何工作負載都會生成海量數據，這為HDD帶來了比算力更具持久性的市場機遇。其前七大核心客户訂單可見度已排至2030至2031年。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583550.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T08:44:12.228408+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T08:23:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T08:38:07.520428+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T08:38:07.520428+00:00","content_hash":"4ed77181c862321973bf15ff8c9f5f20ec309918113bfc2646a938f25263ebfc","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}